{
  "id": "master-v2",
  "name": "浅色商务（v2）",
  "_note": "刻意与 v1 在**几何**上不同（绘图区 344px / 内边距不同 / 绘图区上移量不同），用来证明这些值确实来自母版、而不是写死在生成器里。",
  "assets": "assets",
  "cover": "cover.jpg",
  "files": { "css": "master.css", "gsap": "gsap.min.js", "js": "master.js" },
  "hyperframes": "hyperframes.json",
  "_fontsNote": "★ 与 master-v1 **共用同一份**内嵌字体（../../fonts）：不许各存一份。字符集 = GB2312 一级字表 3755 字 + ASCII + 中英标点（../../fonts/chars-cmn.txt）。",
  "fonts": { "src": "../../fonts", "files": ["NotoSerifSC-sub.woff2", "NotoSansSC-sub.woff2"] },
  "page": 3,
  "canvas": {
    "16:9": { "w": 1280, "h": 720, "portrait": false },
    "9:16": { "w": 720, "h": 1280, "portrait": true }
  },
  "padBase": { "16:9": 84, "9:16": 54 },
  "plot": {
    "16:9": { "w": 1112, "h": 344 },
    "9:16": { "w": 612, "h": 372 }
  },
  "plotPad": { "l": 64, "r": 20, "t": 34, "b": 40 },
  "plotTopOffset": { "16:9": 128, "9:16": 168 },
  "chart": { "barAlpha": 1 },
  "_imageNote": "图片页的媒体区像素矩形（与 master.css 的 .p9--* 规则一致；v2 的面板多 1px 发丝描边，故实测会有 ~1px 差，容差内）。",
  "image": {
    "16:9": {
      "_allowed": ["left", "right", "full"],
      "left": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 589, "h": 720 },
      "right": { "x": 691, "y": 0, "w": 589, "h": 720 },
      "full": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 1280, "h": 720 }
    },
    "9:16": {
      "_allowed": ["full"],
      "_note": "left/right 仅横屏使用（D15）：竖屏下二者是同一条整宽媒体带（720×538），'侧向'语义不成立，契约层已禁（validate-deck.mjs 对 9:16 只允许 full）。规则保留仅为跨几何 CSS 一致性；且竖屏下这两条描边已去掉（否则封面/面板的 1px 描边会把同一条带的图挪 1px）。",
      "left": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 720, "h": 538 },
      "right": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 720, "h": 538 },
      "full": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 720, "h": 1280 }
    }
  },
  "donutShades": [1, 0.78, 0.58],
  "bg": "#f5f6f8",
  "ink": "#1b2430",
  "rule": "rgba(27,36,48,.14)",
  "_paletteNote": "本母版是蓝白商务风，故用自己的命名（azure/steel/indigo/violet）—— 契约里 palette 的名清单由母版提供，跨母版同名同色不再是问题（team-lead 定案）。",
  "palette": {
    "azure": { "accent": "#2f5fa8", "rgb": "47,95,168" },
    "steel": { "accent": "#4a86c8", "rgb": "74,134,200" },
    "indigo": { "accent": "#4b4fa8", "rgb": "75,79,168" },
    "violet": { "accent": "#7a4fa8", "rgb": "122,79,168" }
  }
}
